# Disassembler speed: a tier 1 CPU (9 ingredients) in a disassembler powered by a creative case,
# chest on top for the output. Like in 1.12 / 1.16.5 (2000 energy per ingredient, 25 energy every
# 10 ticks) one ingredient comes out every 40 s; the chest is checked at ~45 s, ~85 s and ~125 s.
forceload add 48 48 64 80
setblock 50 -60 60 opencomputers:casecreative
setblock 51 -60 60 opencomputers:disassembler
setblock 51 -59 60 minecraft:chest
item replace block 51 -60 60 container.0 with opencomputers:cpu1
WAIT 45
data get block 51 -60 60
data get block 51 -59 60 Items
WAIT 40
data get block 51 -59 60 Items
WAIT 40
data get block 51 -59 60 Items
data get block 51 -60 60
